{"3754290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pitaya!", "steam_appid": 3754290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pitaya! is a third-person action RPG where the slightest mistake can spell your doom. Cursed with a dragon’s insatiable appetite, your only hope of survival is to fight, feast, and cook your way through a world that’s rotting from the inside out. Will you master your hunger, or will it master you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT TO FEED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hunger-fueled combat system! Battles are fast, brutal, and messy. Every enemy you defeat can be carved up and eaten in the heat of combat, restoring your strength or pushing you deeper into your curse. The choice is yours: do you play it safe, or risk it all for more power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/1692958cbf835f7e945dda8ba733a5f0.poster.avif?t=1756696140\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/1692958cbf835f7e945dda8ba733a5f0.webm?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/1692958cbf835f7e945dda8ba733a5f0.mp4?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOK YOUR SKILL TREE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your spoils back to the kitchen to craft bizarre and powerful recipes. Every dish you cook unlocks new combat abilities, traversal techniques, or passive perks. Reshaping your playstyle one meal at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/bf6bfffa2245b0f8b46a890e72269e5c.poster.avif?t=1756696140\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/bf6bfffa2245b0f8b46a890e72269e5c.webm?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/bf6bfffa2245b0f8b46a890e72269e5c.mp4?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RAISE OR ROAST YOUR PETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions or Cuisine? Discover doughy creatures known as Kneadlings. Nurture them as loyal allies or feed them to your curse for powerful bonuses. Not every pet makes it to the end of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/a00913910b544d224a546ca214b2cd3d.poster.avif?t=1756696140\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/a00913910b544d224a546ca214b2cd3d.webm?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/a00913910b544d224a546ca214b2cd3d.mp4?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOURSELF THROUGH FLAVOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strength is only as good as your last meal. Scour the land for rare ingredients, experiment with recipes, and decide how much of yourself you’re willing to lose in exchange for power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/50b601b2bbb155b2174d3fb7eb7acc1b.poster.avif?t=1756696140\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/50b601b2bbb155b2174d3fb7eb7acc1b.webm?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/50b601b2bbb155b2174d3fb7eb7acc1b.mp4?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack-and-slash combat driven by hunger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of recipes to discover and master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different zones to explore and devour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill tree made entirely of food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kneadling companions (or ingredients)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A curse that grows stronger the more you feed </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pitaya! is a third-person action RPG where the slightest mistake can spell your doom. Cursed with a dragon’s insatiable appetite, your only hope of survival is to fight, feast, and cook your way through a world that’s rotting from the inside out. Will you master your hunger, or will it master you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT TO FEED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hunger-fueled combat system! Battles are fast, brutal, and messy. Every enemy you defeat can be carved up and eaten in the heat of combat, restoring your strength or pushing you deeper into your curse. The choice is yours: do you play it safe, or risk it all for more power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/1692958cbf835f7e945dda8ba733a5f0.poster.avif?t=1756696140\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/1692958cbf835f7e945dda8ba733a5f0.webm?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/1692958cbf835f7e945dda8ba733a5f0.mp4?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOK YOUR SKILL TREE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your spoils back to the kitchen to craft bizarre and powerful recipes. Every dish you cook unlocks new combat abilities, traversal techniques, or passive perks. Reshaping your playstyle one meal at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/bf6bfffa2245b0f8b46a890e72269e5c.poster.avif?t=1756696140\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/bf6bfffa2245b0f8b46a890e72269e5c.webm?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/bf6bfffa2245b0f8b46a890e72269e5c.mp4?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RAISE OR ROAST YOUR PETS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions or Cuisine? Discover doughy creatures known as Kneadlings. Nurture them as loyal allies or feed them to your curse for powerful bonuses. Not every pet makes it to the end of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/a00913910b544d224a546ca214b2cd3d.poster.avif?t=1756696140\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/a00913910b544d224a546ca214b2cd3d.webm?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/a00913910b544d224a546ca214b2cd3d.mp4?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADE YOURSELF THROUGH FLAVOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strength is only as good as your last meal. Scour the land for rare ingredients, experiment with recipes, and decide how much of yourself you’re willing to lose in exchange for power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/50b601b2bbb155b2174d3fb7eb7acc1b.poster.avif?t=1756696140\" width=600 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/50b601b2bbb155b2174d3fb7eb7acc1b.webm?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/extras/50b601b2bbb155b2174d3fb7eb7acc1b.mp4?t=1756696140\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack-and-slash combat driven by hunger</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of recipes to discover and master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 different zones to explore and devour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill tree made entirely of food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kneadling companions (or ingredients)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A curse that grows stronger the more you feed </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Pitaya! is a 3rd-person action RPG where you play as a cursed girl driven by endless hunger. Explore a strange world, devour enemies, feed bizarre pets, and cook their parts into powerful dishes to unlock new abilities, upgrade your skills, and fight to survive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/fc1eb2b55fe59b97a682b33517a0c32cedfc04b7/header.jpg?t=1756696140", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/b0cc1ae5df8474290ade74f6a05ebf1ba7ee681e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756696140", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/b0cc1ae5df8474290ade74f6a05ebf1ba7ee681e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756696140", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD FX-4350 / Intel® Core™ i3-3210<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon™ RX 460 / NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["OnTheRiseGames"], "publishers": ["OnTheRiseGames"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/94f4f2103810fc06a9d235a0551abd47518c6256/ss_94f4f2103810fc06a9d235a0551abd47518c6256.600x338.jpg?t=1756696140", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754290/94f4f2103810fc06a9d235a0551abd47518c6256/ss_94f